Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: copypaste
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 22)
Description: ephemeral paste layer for humans and agents (copypaste.v1)
 copypaste is a client and server for short-lived text pastes.
 Encryption is AES-256-GCM in the client. There is no public listing.
 The `copypaste serve` command runs a local SQLite-backed API for
 agents and air-gapped use. The hosted web UI speaks the same protocol.
